    {
      "id": "prompt_001",
      "text": "今日、思わず笑ってしまったことは何ですか？",
      "posts": [
        {
          "id": "A27331CF-683D-46E7-84FE-00FD8A513A16",
          "authorID": "F71DC8ED-6519-4F76-9CBD-0ED21889C3C5",
          "authorEmoji": "🌙",
          "authorNickname": "みずき",
          "body": "電車で寝てる人が、急にはっきりした声で「それは違うと思います」って言った。誰と話してたんやろ。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 18
        },
        {
          "id": "A08195C4-4A4C-40BD-91BE-159E77C57C7A",
          "authorID": "1E56339E-92A5-481A-923D-72C2048CF18C",
          "authorEmoji": "🐢",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "My cat tried to jump onto the table, missed completely, and then walked away like nothing had happened.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
          "minutesAgo": 34
        },
        {
          "id": "2735683A-A8DB-4324-ADAD-2DC7C452EA41",
          "authorID": "D1F6A20F-3CCA-48EF-B1A1-7EE9EC475569",
          "authorEmoji": "🌵",
          "authorNickname": "Lucía",
          "body": "Mi abuela me llamó para preguntarme cómo se apaga la televisión. Estaba usando el mando del aire acondicionado.",
          "bodyLanguage": "es",
          "minutesAgo": 51
        },
        {
          "id": "9CCC14F0-732F-43F5-AE71-D050A5C23277",
          "authorID": "DEB10675-152C-4EA7-B9F6-1684C5E49CA0",
          "authorEmoji": "🍞",
          "authorNickname": "지훈",
          "body": "출근길에 신발을 짝짝이로 신고 온 걸 회사에 도착해서야 알았다.",
          "bodyLanguage": "ko",
          "minutesAgo": 72
        },
        {
          "id": "E2525BE9-953E-423B-951C-FFF1BA154FD1",
          "authorID": "EC0C5044-8484-4369-BA3C-6FAB0E3D1543",
          "authorEmoji": "🎈",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "Mon voisin chante faux tous les matins sous la douche. Aujourd'hui il a oublié les paroles.",
          "bodyLanguage": "fr",
          "minutesAgo": 96
        },
        {
          "id": "9546FA31-6696-4814-8504-BC82D4D7B43D",
          "authorID": "95E0E393-C330-4639-889E-DDBC686DAAD3",
          "authorEmoji": "🐳",
          "authorNickname": "Tom",
          "body": "I said \"you too\" to the waiter who told me to enjoy my meal. Every single time.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
          "minutesAgo": 110
        },
        {
          "id": "39A70445-7D02-4EAC-BAD6-76A1FCF46CEE",
          "authorID": "408AB191-43F1-4F41-9845-818F89524F68",
          "authorEmoji": "☕️",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "自販機で買ったつもりのコーヒーが、全然違うボタンのやつだった。まあ美味しかったからよし。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 133
        },
        {
          "id": "163D8D7F-C874-45DD-B512-4F75201243D8",
          "authorID": "2F41AE07-4030-47A2-BCE8-110E70798E01",
          "authorEmoji": "🌻",
          "authorNickname": "Ana",
          "body": "Meu filho de três anos me apresentou o seu \"melhor amigo\": uma pedra.",
          "bodyLanguage": "pt",
          "minutesAgo": 158
        },
        {
          "id": "1BB1C854-3541-45D7-841D-EBD5202663E7",
          "authorID": "76755DE6-E6BF-4DCC-BE5D-804276B60AF0",
          "authorEmoji": "🛴",
          "authorNickname": "Jonas",
          "body": "Ich habe zehn Minuten lang meine Brille gesucht. Sie war die ganze Zeit auf meinem Kopf.",
          "bodyLanguage": "de",
          "minutesAgo": 181
        },
        {
          "id": "A972D1B0-E8A3-4A09-8DDC-4B7A0E9A2384",
          "authorID": "FDCBC9EE-01C9-4599-B004-2D7F934B060C",
          "authorEmoji": "🍊",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "同事把「辛苦了」打成了「幸福了」，整个群突然安静，然后大家都笑了。",
          "bodyLanguage": "zh",
          "minutesAgo": 204
        },
        {
          "id": "396EE953-5D2D-4030-8BC3-F4E8A57835FE",
          "authorID": "B01B1C76-66B1-476B-B073-984FD13A8E1D",
          "authorEmoji": "🪐",
          "authorNickname": "Noor",
          "body": "حاولت أن أفتح باب المتجر وأنا أدفعه ثلاث مرات، وكان مكتوباً عليه بخط كبير: اسحب.",
          "bodyLanguage": "ar",
          "minutesAgo": 227
        },
        {
          "id": "D867EBF2-BB8B-449F-81DB-767DF6D2D2FC",
          "authorID": "E9F93D4F-6A9F-45E3-9553-D242D147CD6D",
          "authorEmoji": "🐧",
          "authorNickname": "さとる",
          "body": "犬が自分のしっぽに驚いてた。毎日同じことしてるのに、毎日はじめてみたいな顔をする。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 249
        },
        {
          "id": "8D4774DE-5140-47AE-8CBA-CA7FC03B8995",
          "authorID": "6EC6D09C-ECAC-4098-AB8B-69A467BF112A",
          "authorEmoji": "🎧",
          "authorNickname": "Marek",
          "body": "Pomyliłem szampon z żelem pod prysznic. Włosy pachną cytryną, ale wyglądają dobrze.",
          "bodyLanguage": "pl",
          "minutesAgo": 271
        },
        {
          "id": "27D12B43-097B-417E-AFD9-8BF33ADE17FA",
          "authorID": "735F5078-2552-4844-AD91-B3B6D8753E9A",
          "authorEmoji": "🍄",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "My grandpa found out what a meme is today. He now sends me one every hour, and none of them make sense.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
          "minutesAgo": 294
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prompt_002",
      "text": "最近、誰かに言われてうれしかった一言は何ですか？",
      "posts": [
        {
          "id": "A7BE2A5F-5F1D-4A6A-B67A-BF87A07FBB0B",
          "authorID": "ACCB549C-C91B-44C0-9D96-1B56288514E2",
          "authorEmoji": "🌿",
          "authorNickname": "はるか",
          "body": "「いつもありがとう」って、母に言われた。当たり前のことをしてるつもりやったのに。",
          "bodyLanguage": "ja",
          "minutesAgo": 21
        },
        {
          "id": "5ED288D2-2979-49AC-B99C-EF38BC68BE0A",
          "authorID": "E63C7BC7-7EA4-4B0C-BEE5-A34FFE01F310",
          "authorEmoji": "🧦",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "A stranger told me my laugh made his day better. I have been self-conscious about it for years.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
          "minutesAgo": 44
        },
        {
          "id": "87E66E0D-BB76-4838-9E8E-3C2EC473FCF5",
          "authorID": "95B19169-409E-4C34-A0C6-D74ACDC61C3F",
          "authorEmoji": "🍋",
          "authorNickname": "서연",
          "body": "팀장님이 \"네 방식대로 해봐\"라고 말해줬다. 처음으로 믿음을 받은 기분.",
          "bodyLanguage": "ko",
          "minutesAgo": 67
        },
        {
          "id": "5E8F4093-3C21-4EB3-99CC-55C73649ADB5",
          "authorID": "53AEED3B-B0AF-42B3-B213-27E6906015B7",
          "authorEmoji": "🌊",
          "authorNickname": "Mateo",
          "body": "Mi hija me dijo: \"papá, contigo no tengo miedo\". Me quedé sin palabras.",
          "bodyLanguage": "es",
          "minutesAgo": 90
        },
        {
          "id": "96D63DD8-2A85-452C-B403-2E6DF6C72110",
          "authorID": "B1B6C79D-F7FD-46A5-B72A-B1D26E579417",
          "authorEmoji": "🎹",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "Une collègue m'a dit que je posais toujours les bonnes questions. Je pensais juste être curieux.",
          "bodyLanguage": "fr",
          "minutesAgo": 113
        },
        {
          "id": "997475B3-0B2D-4280-AE30-EA9683152055",
          "authorID": "6705289F-4F47-42F9-8622-27299566FE47",
          "authorEmoji": "🧶",
          "authorNickname": "Elke",
          "body": "Meine Nachbarin sagte, das Haus sei freundlicher geworden, seit ich hier wohne.",
          "bodyLanguage": "de",
          "minutesAgo": 136
        },
        {
          "id": "DAF9743C-7CDB-473F-9EE0-A15851F47D42",
          "authorID": "8DD02152-4A1D-4891-B5DF-F0FD89E8E741",
          "authorEmoji": "🥚",
          "authorNickname": "Rafa",
          "body": "Meu chefe disse que confia em mim. Foi só isso, mas carreguei essa frase o dia todo.",
          "bodyLanguage": "pt",
          "minutesAgo": 159
        },
        {
          "id": "8D179A30-B0D3-421C-8B61-CE8ED779B266",
          "authorID": "74E85C2A-305D-47DD-91BB-00231C11A004",
          "authorEmoji": "🐿️",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "弟弟说：“哥，我想变成你这样的人。”我偷偷高兴了很久。",
          "bodyLanguage": "zh",
          "minutesAgo": 182
        },
        {
          "id": "CB9B9255-683E-4E0B-830C-E224EB434D21",
          "authorID": "C712DA6A-92DC-474A-970A-A79E7FE6224D",
          "authorEmoji": "🌙",
          "authorNickname": "Layla",
          "body": "قال لي صديقي: \"وجودك يريحني\". لم أعرف بماذا أرد.",
          "bodyLanguage": "ar",
          "minutesAgo": 205
        },
        {
          "id": "A6F50034-4E24-4DBD-853D-C6E82C7150E0",
          "authorID": "A51AB2CE-A716-4D27-96CA-B9F1DFB4B9C7",
          "authorEmoji": "🍅",
          "authorNickname": "Giulia",
          "body": "Un cliente mi ha detto che il mio pane sa di casa sua. Lavoro da vent'anni per una frase così.",
          "bodyLanguage": "it",
          "minutesAgo": 228
        },
        {
          "id": "0B0CA53F-D3F0-42AA-8B5F-1F854DB2752B",
          "authorID": "63DA91C8-F2C6-4EA3-80DA-0E8F81F3976B",
          "authorEmoji": "🛶",
          "authorNickname": null,
          "body": "Kata guru saya: \"kamu boleh pelan, yang penting jangan berhenti\".",
          "bodyLanguage": "id",
          "minutesAgo": 251
        },
        {
          "id": "69866C9E-076F-46B7-81A4-9D4AE0F67592",
          "authorID": "0B679032-24AC-47EE-A5C0-1475AC49291F",
          "authorEmoji": "📚",
          "authorNickname": "Sam",
          "body": "My roommate said the flat feels quieter when I am away. Nobody had ever missed me out loud before.",
          "bodyLanguage": "en",
          "minutesAgo": 274
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
